docs {
  # Social Wire Gateway

  Bruno workspace for HTTP routes on `services/gateway` (OAuth, sync, PDS writes, AppView/Operations proxies, L@tr, and telemetry).

  ## Folders

  - **Health** — liveness
  - **OAuth** — public client metadata (no auth)
  - **Sync** — authenticated preference sync + PDS record cache
  - **Publications** — sidebar projection (proxied to AppView when `APPVIEW_BASE_URL` is set) and PDS write-through
  - **AppView** — Thin AppView routes proxied to AppView when configured (including NDJSON bootstrap stream)
  - **Latr** — native L@tr proxy routes (requires gateway, L@tr, and sometimes upstream-PDS DPoP proofs)
  - **Operations** — operator-only control-plane routes proxied to the Operations service
  - **Telemetry** — authenticated client performance telemetry

  Set `oauthAccessToken` and `dpopProof` from an ATProto OAuth session before calling `/v1/*`.
}
